flowchart TB
  N["Native Rust caller"] -->|"typed rule call"| O["Invocation owner in rules crate<br/>preflight, scheduling, report and cleanup"]
  P["Skill tool or optional TS caller"] -->|"versioned request"| C["Executable boundary<br/>framing and serialization"]
  C --> O
  O <-->|"selected definitions or diagnostics"| R["Rule admission owner<br/>RuleSet JSON + JSONL questions"]
  O <-->|"frozen evidence or source errors"| E["Evidence crate<br/>changes, targets, related sources and chunks"]
  C -->|"direct evidence operation"| E
  O <-->|"occurrence selection records"| F["Selection owner<br/>applicability and dependencies"]
  O <-->|"request / validated outcome"| J["Judgment owner in decisions crate<br/>correlation and safe failures"]
  J <-->|"body / attempt observations"| B["Jev adapter<br/>HTTP attempts and private credentials"]
  B <-->|"native JSON / response"| X["OpenRouter System One"]
  O <-->|"bindings / source-linked answers"| V["Rule result correlation<br/>one canonical execution outcome"]
  J -.-> A["Future adapter<br/>not implemented in v1"]
